### Get all recipes
GET http://localhost:8080/recipes


### Create a recipe
POST http://localhost:8080/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Chicken Alfredo",
  "description": "Creamy pasta with chicken",
  "ingredients": ["chicken", "fettuccine", "cream", "parmesan"],
  "instructions": "Cook pasta. Cook chicken. Make sauce. Combine everything.",
  "prepTime": 15,
  "cookTime": 25,
  "servings": 4,
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "category": "dinner"
}

### Get one recipe by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/recipes/:recipeId

### Get all categories
GET http://localhost:8080/categories

### Create a category
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "dinner",
  "description": "Main meal recipes"
}

